  "description": {
    "en": "The Dunlop CX 200 TOUR 18x20 2024 is a tour-level control racquet built for advanced players seeking maximum precision, feel and directional consistency. Its compact 95 sq.in head, 315 g unstrung weight, 310 mm head-light balance and dense 18x20 string pattern provide exceptional stability and control. SONIC CORE with Infinergy improves rebound and vibration absorption, VIBROSHIELD enhances comfort and feel, POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ supports spin and power, while CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY improves stability and precision through the swing.",

    "zh": "Dunlop CX 200 TOUR 18x20 2024 是一款面向高水平及比赛型球员的极致控制型球拍。它采用95平方英寸拍面、315克空拍重量、310毫米头轻平衡、18×20密集线床以及20.5毫米恒定薄框设计，强调精准落点、稳定性与细腻击球反馈。SONIC CORE with Infinergy 提升回弹与减震表现，VIBROSHIELD 改善舒适性与手感，POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ 增强击球表现，而 CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY 则进一步提升拍框稳定性与挥拍过程中的精准度。"
  },

